        "title": "Neovim have a ~$800k Bitcoin donation sitting untouched since 2023",
        "link": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49738879",
        "description": "<p>I was looking at neovim's donation footer at the bottom of their site and saw a bitcoin donation address.<p>Thought I'd check how much in donations they've gotten. And I saw this massive 10 Bitcoin donation from back in 2023 (worth $800,000 now...)<p>From the activity history, neovim last sent bitcoin out of the address in 2019 so it's been max 7 years since they've definitely had access.<p>Does anyone from the neovim project know about this? \nSeems like a pretty significant amount of funding to have sitting there. Hope it can come to good use as I use neovim daily.<p>https://www.blockchain.com/explorer/addresses/btc/1Evu6wPrzjsjrNPdCYbHy3HT6ry2EzXFyQ</p>\n<hr>\n<p>Comments URL: <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49738879\">https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49738879</a></p>\n<p>Points: 25</p>\n<p># Comments: 2</p>",
